### 狀態檢查
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### 取得清單
GET http://localhost:3001/api/signup

### 建立報名（成功）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "小明",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "password": "demoPass88",
  "confirmPassword": "demoPass88",
  "interests": ["後端入門"]
}

### 建立報名（失敗：手機格式錯誤）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "錯誤者",
  "email": "err@test.com",
  "phone": "123",
  "password": "demoPass88",
  "confirmPassword": "demoPass88",
  "interests": ["後端入門"]
}
